# _**African Flash Mob**_

Who has seen a flash mob in real life? I have only ever witnessed these awesome [African Dance Flash Mob](http://http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y_IYa-LoHUM) events on YOUTUBE and now over the past two weeks I have had invites to two Melbourne African Flash mobs! How fun it would be to take part in such a grand performance. Perhaps we should get a Sunshine Plaza flash mob?...Anyway for now, if your in Melbourne over the next few months: [African Flash mob 1](http://https://www.facebook.com/events/435743976520355/) - 18th May at Emerge Festival in the West, Footscray. [African Flash Mob 2](http://https://www.facebook.com/melbdjembe?fref=ts) - CBD Mid June We will post up any footage we can get a hold of....FUN! -Peace and Rhythm
